                <pb facs="0211" n="201" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv05/pg201"/>

                <head>Appendix III</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Valuation Clause</hi></p>
                <p>Clause (D). The damage for repairing, reconstructing and rebuilding property in
                    the invaded and devastated districts, including reinstallation of furniture,
                    machinery and other equipment, will be measured by the cost at the dates when
                    the work is done.</p>
